<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-text">
    <h1>Connecting volunteers with service opportunities</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      The CSE 340 Service Network brings together local organizations, volunteers, and
      service projects in one place, so anyone can find a meaningful way to help their
      community this week.
    </p>
    <a class="button" href="/projects">See the service projects</a>
  </div>
  <img class="hero-image" src="/images/cse340-service-network.svg"
       alt="Illustration of three volunteers working together on a community service project.">
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>Our mission</h2>
  <p>
    Many people want to serve but do not know where to start. Our mission is to remove that
    barrier: we list the partner organizations, describe the projects they run, and group
    every opportunity into clear categories so volunteers can find the right fit quickly.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>How the network works</h2>
  <div class="card-grid">
    <article class="card">
      <h3>1. Explore organizations</h3>
      <p>
        Browse the partner organizations that coordinate service in our area and learn what
        each one focuses on.
      </p>
      <a href="/organizations">View organizations</a>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h3>2. Choose a project</h3>
      <p>
        Each organization runs specific service projects with a clear purpose, schedule,
        and set of tasks for volunteers.
      </p>
      <a href="/projects">View service projects</a>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h3>3. Serve by category</h3>
      <p>
        Prefer environmental work, tutoring, or health outreach? Categories let you filter
        opportunities by the kind of service you enjoy.
      </p>
      <a href="/categories">View categories</a>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
